    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-sir22">
        <head xml:id="gom-sir22-Hd1e98">Caput 22</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir22-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir22-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir22-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir22-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir22_1@1-2">In lapide,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir22-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-sir22-Nd1e110" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir22-Qd1e113"><seg type="qs">Quando peccatorum duris Scripturarum sententiis foeditas</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">a praedicatoribus improperatur.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir22-Dd1e122">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir22-Hd1e124">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir22-d1e126">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir22-Qd1e128" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir22_6@1-1">Musica.</quote>
            Eos notat, qui in Ecclesia plausum populi et favorem quaerunt, nec magis compunctionem lacrymarum excitant.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir22-Dd1e133">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir22-Hd1e135">Versus 7</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir22-d1e137">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir22-Qd1e139" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir22_7@1-3">Qui docet fatuum.</quote>
            Testa multo labore confecta fragilitatem suam non evadit. Fatuus quoque quamvis sollicite erudiatur, vix ad perfectionem <pb ed="#P" n="1206C"/> perducitur.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir22-Dd1e146">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir22-Hd1e148">Versus 10</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir22-d1e150">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir22-Qd1e152" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir22_10@1-2">Supra mortuum.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir22-Rd1e155"><name xml:id="gom-sir22-Nd1e156" ref="#RabanusMaurus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir22-Qd1e159"><seg type="qs">Altera est mors corporis</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">mors enim corporis, finis laboris mundani</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir22-Dd1e169">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir22-Hd1e171">Versus 14</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir22-d1e173">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir22-Qd1e175" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir22_14@1-2">Cum stulto.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir22-Rd1e178"><name xml:id="gom-sir22-Nd1e179" ref="#RabanusMaurus">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir22-Qd1e182"><seg type="qs">Docet cum stultis sermonem non esse protrahendum</seg>, etc., usque ad: <seg type="qs"><quote xml:id="gom-sir22-Qd1e187" source="http://scta.info/resource/IIio1_11@1-9">Qui enim dixerit ei ave, communicat ejus operibus malignis</quote>.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir22-Dd1e193">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir22-Hd1e195">Versus 17</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir22-d1e197">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir22-Qd1e199" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir22_17@1-2">Super plumbum.</quote>
            Hinc Salomon ait: <quote xml:id="gom-sir22-Qd1e202" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov27_3@1-11">Grave est saxum et onerosa arena, sed ira stulti utroque gravior</quote>. Pejus peccat haereticus quam catholicus, in multitudine multorum malorum; vel philosophus qui humana nititur sapientia; vel gentilis, qui non pervenit ad fidem, et ignoranter peccat: unde, <quote xml:id="gom-sir22-Qd1e205">Servus</quote> enim <quote xml:id="gom-sir22-Qd1e207" source="http://scta.info/resource/lc12_47@4-19">qui scit voluntatem <pb ed="#P" n="1206D"/> domini sui, et non facit: vapulabit multis</quote>. Qui autem nescit, paucis.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir22-Dd1e214">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir22-Hd1e216">Versus 19</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir22-d1e218">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir22-Qd1e220" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir22_19@1-1">Loramentum.</quote>
            Ligna justos signant, qui fructum dant in tempore, quorum folia non decidunt: et omnia quae faciunt prosperantur; fundamentum autem aedificii, apostolos vel prophetas, quorum praedicatio Ecclesiam sustinet.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir22-d1e224">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir22-Qd1e226" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir22_19@1-7">Loramentum ergo ligneum colligatum fundamento aedificii non dissolvitur:</quote>
            quia fides passionis Christi in cordibus hominum adjuncta doctrinae apostolorum, indissolubile facit Ecclesiae aedificium.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir22-Dd1e231">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir22-Hd1e233">Versus 21</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir22-d1e235">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir22-Qd1e237" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir22_21">Sicut paleae,</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            etc. Unde: Qui audit verba mea, et non facit ea, similis est viro stulto, qui aedificat domum suam super arenam.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir22-Dd1e244">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir22-Hd1e246">Versus 23</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir22-d1e248">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1207A"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir22-Qd1e252" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir22_23">Sicut cor.</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            <ref xml:id="gom-sir22-Rd1e257"><name xml:id="gom-sir22-Nd1e258" ref="#RabanusMaurus">RAB.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir22-Qd1e261"><seg type="qs">Sicut limpidus paries</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">sic cor fatui spernit scelerum recordationem nec poenas timet aeternas.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir22-Dd1e270">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir22-Hd1e272">Versus 25</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir22-d1e274">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir22-Qd1e276" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir22_25@1-2">Mittens lapidem.</quote>
            Ostendit quid amicum bonum conservet, vel potius alienet.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir22-d1e280">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir22-Qd1e282" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir22_25@1-2">Mittens lapidem.</quote>
            Sicut lapidis ictu volatus avium dejicitur, ita convicii verbo vis amicitiae dissolvitur.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir22-Dd1e288">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir22-Hd1e290">Versus 26</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir22-d1e292">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir22-Qd1e294" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir22_26@7-8">Non desperes.</quote>
            De amicitia ejus, quia agnita correctionis utilitate regreditur ad jus pristinae amicitiae.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir22-Dd1e299">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir22-Hd1e301">Versus 27</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir22-d1e303">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir22-Qd1e305" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir22_27@25-26">Effugiet amicus.</quote>
            Non rediturus, nec post reconciliationem; unde: Amico reconciliatione credas in aeternum.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir22-Dd1e310">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir22-Hd1e312">Versus 29</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir22-d1e314">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir22-Qd1e316" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir22_29@1-3">In tempore tribulationis.</quote>
            In adversitate magis probatur amicus. Multi enim amici mensae, <pb ed="#P" n="1207B"/> et non permanent in die necessitatis.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir22-Dd1e323">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir22-Hd1e325">Versus 30</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir22-d1e327">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir22-Qd1e329" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir22_30@1-2">Ante ignem,</quote>
            etc. Sicut fumus praecedit ignis incendium, sic dura verba homicidium; unde, <quote xml:id="gom-sir22-Qd1e332" source="http://scta.info/resource/prov15_1@5-7">Sermo durus suscitat rixas</quote>. Et alibi: <quote xml:id="gom-sir22-Qd1e335" source="http://scta.info/resource/mt5_22@7-13">Qui irascitur fratri suo, reus erit judicio</quote>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir22-Dd1e340">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir22-Hd1e342">Versus 31</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir22-d1e344">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir22-Qd1e346" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir22_31@1-2">Amicum salutare.</quote>
            Multa bona sunt in amicitia vera: congaudet enim verus amicus in bonis tuis, et contristatur in malis.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-sir22-Dd1e351">
          <head xml:id="gom-sir22-Hd1e353">Versus 32</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-sir22-d1e355">
            <quote xml:id="gom-sir22-Qd1e357" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/sir22_32@1-3">Omnis qui audiet.</quote>
            Id est, qui cognoscit quanta bona sint in amicitia vera, cavebit ne injuria, vel convicio amicum laedat.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
